---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about Wayne Sheppard and BAM Team Services LLC's journey in technology innovation">
	<section class="py-16 md:py-24">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">About BAM Team Services</h1>
			
			<div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600">
				<p class="text-xl mb-8 text-gray-700">
					BAM Team Services LLC is the brainchild of Wayne Sheppard, a visionary technology leader with over three decades of pioneering innovation in telecommunications, software development, and business transformation.
				</p>

				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Wayne Sheppard: A Legacy of Innovation</h2>
				
				<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Early Pioneering Years</h3>
				<p>
					In the late 1980s, Mr. Sheppard founded BMCI, establishing himself as a leader in wireless security and regional mobile phone RCC technologies. He was among the first entrants to Computer Telephony Integration and IVR Service Bureau solutions, recognizing early the transformative potential of integrating telecommunications with computing.
				</p>

				<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">CONTACT, Inc.: Custom Solutions for Industry Leaders</h3>
				<p>
					Building on this foundation, Mr. Sheppard founded CONTACT, Inc., a boutique custom IVR development provider. Under his leadership, CONTACT delivered sophisticated voice response solutions to prestigious clients including:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-4 mb-6">
					<li>Allstate Insurance</li>
					<li>Sun Life of Canada</li>
					<li>John Hancock Insurance</li>
					<li>Federal Express</li>
					<li>American Express</li>
				</ul>

				<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">SpeechCraft, Inc.: Voice Recognition Pioneer</h3>
				<p>
					Funded by an insurance industry group, SpeechCraft, Inc. represented another leap forward in 1994. The company introduced the industry's first voice recognition-based address change service, achieving a remarkable 95%+ successful transaction rate—a breakthrough achievement at the time.
				</p>

				<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">CTI Expertise and Enterprise Consulting</h3>
				<p>
					In 1996, Mr. Sheppard turned his full attention to the Computer Telephony Integration (CTI) space. His expertise became sought after by industry giants, with consulting clients including:
				</p>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6">
					<ul class="list-disc list-inside">
						<li>Genesys Telecommunications Labs</li>
						<li>Andersen Consulting</li>
						<li>Deloitte and Touche</li>
						<li>Sprint</li>
					</ul>
					<ul class="list-disc list-inside">
						<li>MCI</li>
						<li>Bank of America</li>
						<li>Charles Schwab</li>
						<li>And many others</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Today: Technology and Change for Good</h2>
				<p>
					BAM Team Services LLC represents the culmination of this extensive experience. With a current focus on "Technology and Change for Good," the company leverages Mr. Sheppard's deep expertise to guide organizations through digital transformation, strategic planning, and innovative problem-solving.
				</p>
				
				<p>
					As the Technology and Business Process Whisperer, BAM Team Services supports a portfolio of forward-thinking business units including acmemarketing.us, bemorefree.com, disendarkenment.com, healthcareactivist.org, and mindlooker.com—each dedicated to creating positive impact through technology and innovation.
				</p>

				<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8 mt-12">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Our Mission</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-700 italic">
						To harness decades of technology leadership and innovation experience in service of meaningful change, helping organizations navigate complexity and achieve transformative growth.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>